--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

None bundled. The application is a single HTML file built from the sources in
this repository: HTML, CSS, JavaScript and translations. It bundles no TTS
engine, framework, analytics or font files. Text-to-speech is provided by the
browser's Web Speech API and its available system or browser voice services.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
External services and privacy
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The application has no application backend, telemetry or analytics. Text and
settings are saved locally by the application. A local voice processes text
on the device. A remote or online voice may send text to its speech provider
for synthesis; consult that provider's privacy policy before reading
sensitive material. The application labels voices as local, online or unknown
when the browser exposes that information.
